    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Step to the beat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/77b3bba9e52d0354f349251e5d613f38.poster.avif?t=1753699637\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/77b3bba9e52d0354f349251e5d613f38.webm?t=1753699637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/77b3bba9e52d0354f349251e5d613f38.mp4?t=1753699637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asterika is a grid-based rhythm game about movement and flow. Move with the music, weave through obstacles, and adapt to shifting tempos and patterns!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Carve your path</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no fixed button patterns you need to press. Instead, feel the beat, observe the incoming dangers, and find your own way forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Follow the story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/d0da60efa1f4c6126b076d7c86eeb9bf.poster.avif?t=1753699637\" width=480 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/d0da60efa1f4c6126b076d7c86eeb9bf.webm?t=1753699637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/d0da60efa1f4c6126b076d7c86eeb9bf.mp4?t=1753699637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into optional narrative of Asterika as the &quot;Engineer&quot;, caught in the pursuit between two girls and their conflict tied to a magic-fueled city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Build your own challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a curated selection of piano and electronic tracks from talented artists with varying difficulties. But go further and use the built-in beatmap editor to create your custom stages and share!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Step to the beat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/77b3bba9e52d0354f349251e5d613f38.poster.avif?t=1753699637\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/77b3bba9e52d0354f349251e5d613f38.webm?t=1753699637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/77b3bba9e52d0354f349251e5d613f38.mp4?t=1753699637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asterika is a grid-based rhythm game about movement and flow. Move with the music, weave through obstacles, and adapt to shifting tempos and patterns!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Carve your path</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no fixed button patterns you need to press. Instead, feel the beat, observe the incoming dangers, and find your own way forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Follow the story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/d0da60efa1f4c6126b076d7c86eeb9bf.poster.avif?t=1753699637\" width=480 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/d0da60efa1f4c6126b076d7c86eeb9bf.webm?t=1753699637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690850/extras/d0da60efa1f4c6126b076d7c86eeb9bf.mp4?t=1753699637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into optional narrative of Asterika as the &quot;Engineer&quot;, caught in the pursuit between two girls and their conflict tied to a magic-fueled city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Build your own challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a curated selection of piano and electronic tracks from talented artists with varying difficulties. But go further and use the built-in beatmap editor to create your custom stages and share!</p>",
